        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "attrs": {
          "blockId": "dev-boundary"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "这是可修改的演练文稿。用户报告、假设、提议与待验项分别标注；不代表当前软件仍有这些缺陷，不代表任何测试已通过。关闭示例不承诺保存，继续使用前请导出。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "blockId": "dev-expression",
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "表达 · 问题、需求和方案分开"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "attrs": {
          "blockId": "dev-expression-list"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "attrs": {
              "blockId": "dev-report"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "attrs": {
                  "blockId": "dev-report-text"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "R-01【用户报告】恢复桌面时，早已收回的花瓣也出现了。先核对安装版本、操作入口和步骤，不能从一句报告直接断定根因。"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " → "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "补齐证据",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "link",
                        "attrs": {
                          "href": "#aiy-block:dev-evidence"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "attrs": {
              "blockId": "dev-need"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "attrs": {
                  "blockId": "dev-need-text"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "N-01【需求】作者暂停工作后，能只恢复仍在使用的入口；主动收回的内容保持收回，未保存输入不丢失。"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " → "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "可观察的验收",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "link",
                        "attrs": {
                          "href": "#aiy-block:dev-acceptance"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "attrs": {
              "blockId": "dev-scope"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "attrs": {
                  "blockId": "dev-scope-text"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "边界：本次不是重写桌面管理器，不是增加自动置顶，不是删除原内容，也不从“恢复”推导全库重新贴出。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "blockId": "dev-research",
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "调研 · 原始材料、观察、假设和未知"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "attrs": {
          "blockId": "dev-research-list"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "attrs": {
              "blockId": "dev-evidence"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "attrs": {
                  "blockId": "dev-evidence-text"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "E-01【待采集】最短复现步骤、实际构建与系统、操作前后画面和状态。只保留必要诊断，不附凭据或整个私人资料库。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "attrs": {
              "blockId": "dev-code-evidence"
