            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "attrs": {
                  "blockId": "dev-hypothesis-text"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "H-01【假设】某个入口可能把“已有内容”当成“允许恢复的入口”。这只是待验证解释，不写成事实。"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " → "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "设计小试",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "link",
                        "attrs": {
                          "href": "#aiy-block:dev-trial"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "attrs": {
              "blockId": "dev-counterexample"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "attrs": {
                  "blockId": "dev-counterexample-text"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "反例：作者明确重新贴出已收回项是合法动作；图层隐藏、窗口暂时不可见与主动收回也不是同一状态。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "blockId": "dev-trial",
