      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "blockId": "dev-maintenance",
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "主循环 · 下一轮需求／修复"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "attrs": {
          "blockId": "dev-maintenance-list"
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "attrs": {
              "blockId": "dev-next"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "attrs": {
                  "blockId": "dev-next-text"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "新反馈先关联受影响版本、原需求和上次决定，再形成下一轮问题；不是把每条评论都自动建成开发任务。"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " → "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "返回表达",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "link",
                        "attrs": {
                          "href": "#aiy-block:dev-expression"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "attrs": {
              "blockId": "dev-upgrade"
